  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of HCFC Phase-out Management Plan (Stage III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the project is to prepare the Stage III of HCFC Phase-out Management Plan (HPMP). The project will cover the period from 2026 until 2030 and will help the country completely phase out the consumption of HCFCs by 2030, in line with the Montreal Protocol reduction schedule.</narrative>
  </description>
